This Terraform program creates an AWS S3 bucket and an AWS CodeBuild project that runs students' code stored on GitHub. The S3 bucket is used to store the results of the CodeBuild project. The CodeBuild project is configured to run the code in a specific environment and store the results in the S3 bucket. The program also creates a random ID for the S3 bucket name.

Note that this program assumes that the user has already created an AWS IAM role with the necessary permissions for the CodeBuild project. The ARN of the IAM role is specified in the `service_role` attribute of the `aws_codebuild_project` resource.

