Finally, note that the `aws_lightsail_instance_attachment` resource has two attributes: `instance_name` and `disk_name`. The `instance_name` attribute is used to specify the name of the Lightsail instance to attach the disk to, and the `disk_name` attribute is used to specify the name of the Lightsail disk to attach to the instance.

