The `aws_security_group` resource block creates a security group with the name "test-lb-tf-sg" and specifies the VPC ID. The `ingress` and `egress` blocks specify the ingress and egress rules for the security group, respectively. The `tags` block specifies the tags for the security group.

The `aws_subnet` resource block creates a subnet with the name "test-lb-tf-subnet" and specifies the VPC ID, CIDR block, and availability zone. The `tags` block specifies the tags for the subnet.

Note that this configuration assumes that the VPC ID, IPAM pool ID, and S3 bucket name are known and valid. If these values are not known, you may need to modify the configuration accordingly.

