This Terraform configuration creates a VPC, a private subnet, and an internal load balancer in the private subnet. The load balancer is configured to listen on port 80 and forward traffic to the private subnet.

Note that this configuration assumes that the VPC and subnet already exist, and that the private subnet is in the same region as the load balancer. If you need to create these resources as well, you can add them to the configuration as needed.

