This Terraform configuration creates a Gateway Load Balancer with the name "gateway-lb" in the us-east-1 region. The load balancer is associated with two subnets, and it has access logs and connection logs enabled. It also has an IPAM pool and a minimum load balancer capacity. The subnet mappings specify the allocation ID and private IPv4 address for each subnet. The timeouts block specifies the timeouts for the create, delete, and update operations.

Note that this configuration assumes that the "my-access-logs-bucket", "my-connection-logs-bucket", "ipam-pool-12345678", and "subnet-12345678" and "subnet-87654321" resources already exist in the AWS account. If these resources do not exist, you will need to create them before running this Terraform configuration.

