This Terraform configuration creates a Load Balancer with an ALB Target Group. The Load Balancer is named "my-load-balancer" and is accessible from the internet. The Target Group is named "my-target-group" and is associated with the Load Balancer. The Target Group has a health check that checks the health of the targets every 30 seconds and terminates unhealthy targets. The Target Group also has stickiness enabled, which ensures that requests from a client are always sent to the same target. The Target Group has a target failover policy that terminates targets that are deregistered or become unhealthy. The Target Group also has a target health state policy that enables unhealthy connection termination and sets the unhealthy draining interval to 10 seconds.

